    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome to an immersive horror experience where the familiar becomes unsettling, and the mundane turns into a waking nightmare. Explore an abandoned liminal space trapped in the eerie twilight of darkness, where reality blurs and the past refuses to let go.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Overview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Backrooms you take on the role of a lone explorer drawn to a forgotten neighborhood by cryptic messages and haunting visions. As you delve deeper into the desolate streets, you\u2019ll uncover the dark secrets that led to its abandonment. Every corner and hallway holds pieces of the puzzle, but be warned: you are not alone. Shadows move in the periphery of your vision, and echoes of the past resonate through the empty halls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEerie Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted environment where the ordinary becomes sinister. The game's ambient soundscape and chilling visuals create a palpable sense of dread.<br />\r\nExploration-Based Horror: Navigate through an open-world liminal space. Each corner hides its own story, revealed through environmental storytelling and hidden clues.<br />\r\nUnravel the Mystery: Piece together the history of the suburb through journals, photographs, and artifacts. Uncover the truth behind the mass disappearance of its residents and the malevolent force that lingers.<br />\r\nDynamic Encounters: Encounter unpredictable, supernatural entities that stalk the shadows. Use your wits to evade them, as direct confrontation is rarely an option.<br />\r\nPsychological Horror Elements: Experience a narrative that plays with your mind, challenging your perception of reality and making you question what is real and what is imagined.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive the Shadows!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour journey will test your courage and resolve. Will you uncover the truth behind the abandoned suburb, or will you become another lost soul wandering its streets? Backrooms invites you to face your fears and explore the thin line between reality and the supernatural.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDare to enter the shadows?",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to an immersive horror experience where the familiar becomes unsettling, and the mundane turns into a waking nightmare. Explore an abandoned liminal space trapped in the eerie twilight of darkness, where reality blurs and the past refuses to let go.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Overview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Backrooms you take on the role of a lone explorer drawn to a forgotten neighborhood by cryptic messages and haunting visions. As you delve deeper into the desolate streets, you\u2019ll uncover the dark secrets that led to its abandonment. Every corner and hallway holds pieces of the puzzle, but be warned: you are not alone. Shadows move in the periphery of your vision, and echoes of the past resonate through the empty halls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEerie Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted environment where the ordinary becomes sinister. The game's ambient soundscape and chilling visuals create a palpable sense of dread.<br />\r\nExploration-Based Horror: Navigate through an open-world liminal space. Each corner hides its own story, revealed through environmental storytelling and hidden clues.<br />\r\nUnravel the Mystery: Piece together the history of the suburb through journals, photographs, and artifacts. Uncover the truth behind the mass disappearance of its residents and the malevolent force that lingers.<br />\r\nDynamic Encounters: Encounter unpredictable, supernatural entities that stalk the shadows. Use your wits to evade them, as direct confrontation is rarely an option.<br />\r\nPsychological Horror Elements: Experience a narrative that plays with your mind, challenging your perception of reality and making you question what is real and what is imagined.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive the Shadows!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour journey will test your courage and resolve. Will you uncover the truth behind the abandoned suburb, or will you become another lost soul wandering its streets? Backrooms invites you to face your fears and explore the thin line between reality and the supernatural.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDare to enter the shadows?",
    "short_description": "Explore an abandoned liminal space. Uncover dark secrets through eerie exploration and environmental storytelling. Evade unpredictable supernatural entities and face psychological horror. Will you reveal the truth or become another lost soul?",
